@startuml 09-list-sessions
title GET /api/chat/sessions - lista sesji (operator widzi rozmowy)

actor "Admin UI\n(/sessions)" as UI
participant "ChatController" as Ctrl
participant "ListSessionsUseCase\n(ChatService)" as CS
participant "ChatRepository" as CR
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

UI -> Ctrl: GET /api/chat/sessions?page=0&size=20&sort=lastActivityAt,desc
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> CS: list(Pageable)
activate CS
CS -> CR: findAllSessions(pageable)
CR -> DB: SELECT id, tenant_id, anonymous_id,\n  external_id, started_at, last_activity_at,\n  metadata\nFROM chat_sessions\nWHERE tenant_id = ?\nORDER BY last_activity_at DESC\nLIMIT 20
note over DB #LightBlue: Multi-tenant isolation\nprzez Hibernate @TenantId

CR --> CS: Page<ChatSession>
deactivate CS

loop dla każdej sesji
  Ctrl -> CS: countMessages(sessionId)
  CS -> CR: countMessages
  CR -> DB: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM messages\nWHERE session_id = ? AND tenant_id = ?
  CR --> CS: long
  CS --> Ctrl: count
end
note over Ctrl #LightYellow: N+1 problem dla MVP\n(20 sesji = 21 queries).\nPost-MVP: subquery w 1 SELECT.

Ctrl -> Ctrl: ChatApiMapper.toPaginatedSessions

Ctrl --> UI: 200 + {\n  content: [\n    {id, anonymousId, startedAt, lastActivityAt,\n     messageCount, metadata}\n  ],\n  pagination: {...}\n}
deactivate Ctrl

note over UI #LightBlue: Klikalność wiersza →\nnawigacja do /sessions/:id\n(patrz 10-session-history)

@enduml
